ategoryId":"main-idea","exerciseKinds":["application"],"sourceKind":"legacy-unverified","familyId":"notes-origin-notes-source-example-000204","exposureGroupId":"notes-exposure-notes-source-example-000204","answerMode":"single-choice","origin":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"title-writing","tabId":"example","sourceExampleRecordId":"notes-source-example-000204","expectedBlockSha256":"679e0d0102bd84617da20d8fc3d57c24f9833bfbe65b8ba8a240118de5ed0035"},"originAdaptation":{"kind":"neutral-display-completion","instruction":"选择最适合做这段文字标题的一项。","reason":"现有笔记块保留题干、四个选项、答案和解析，但遗漏题目问法；公开同题题面核对出原任务方向。仅补中性作答说明，不改变现有题目内容或宣称官方题源。"},"assessment":{"taskType":"complete-application","knowledgeAtomIds":[],"requiresCalculation":false},"primaryTargetIds":["notes-target-app-ve02-000204"],"supportingTargetIds":[],"refs":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"title-writing","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"e8eeca30c8e10da182c3fd3e38ee43bd8846682b5aa259ea41ab60a71099be27","fingerprint":"ceb386d2"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"title-writing","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"1dc787a8502cae8748cc9e25cbb54129d3a2dc83edf4defcbda7aac0e733afae","fingerprint":"356e296f"}],"distractorReasons":{"A":"强调利用既有战机，未概括主动创造战机。","B":"强调辨别而非制造。","C":"谋略是手段，察隙不是文段主张。"},"originTask":{"verified":true,"statement":"兵法中说\"必胜之术，合变之形，妙在于乘\"，强调作战中乘敌之隙的重要性。战场上激烈角逐中，战机从来不是无缘无故就有的，敌之隙不可能轻而易举地得到，它是双方指挥员进行谋略博弈的结果，离不开指挥员发挥主观能动性去创造，离不开指挥员利用各种手段去促成。信息化战争中，要充分运用谋略、善用战术技术手段，灵活运用隐真示假、声东击西等方法，诱惑敌人产生错觉，产生部署失误、行动失当等\"隙\"，使有准备之敌变成无准备之敌、使集中之敌变成分散之敌、使占地利之敌变成运动之敌、使士气旺盛之敌变成士气低落之敌、使难打之敌变成好打之敌，并伺机击敌，达成作战胜利。\n最适合做这段文字标题的是：","evidence":"公开同题题面与现有题干、选项和答案相符；仅恢复作答方向，考试年份与官方真题身份未认证。"},"reviewVerified":false,"resourceType":"question","prompt":"选择最适合做这段文字标题的一项。\n兵法中说\"必胜之术，合变之形，妙在于乘\"，强调作战中乘敌之隙的重要性。战场上激烈角逐中，战机从来不是无缘无故就有的，敌之隙不可能轻而易举地得到，它是双方指挥员进行谋略博弈的结果，离不开指挥员发挥主观能动性去创造，离不开指挥员利用各种手段去促成。信息化战争中，要充分运用谋略、善用战术技术手段，灵活运用隐真示假、声东击西等方法，诱惑敌人产生错觉，产生部署失误、行动失当等\"隙\"，使有准备之敌变成无准备之敌、使集中之敌变成分散之敌、使占地利之敌变成运动之敌、使士气旺盛之敌变成士气低落之敌、使难打之敌变成好打之敌，并伺机击敌，达成作战胜利。","options":[{"key":"A","text":"科学预见，敢于乘敌之隙"},{"key":"B","text":"沉着冷静，精于辨敌之隙"},{"key":"C","text":"运用谋略，善于察敌之隙"},{"key":"D","text":"主动作为，工于造敌之隙"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"A 强调利用敌隙，未概括文段重点的主动创造和促成敌隙。B 强调辨别敌隙，与后文造隙不符。C 谋略是造隙手段，“察敌之隙”不是文段主张。D 同时体现主动作为和制造敌隙，正确。","originalExampleFingerprint":"bcd345dc","declaredOriginalSource":null,"answerSourceKeys":["[\"verbal\",\"title-writing\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-ve02-000204","questionRevision":2,"effectiveContentDigest":"e9ea66b6ab353ca060217071b4f30dfc505fd6fe18340aef219b67b580284bc4"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-ve02-000204","revision":2,"sha256":"830b6e752526f49b6b63d11050af5bff98bbe054e53ee2f237faedb1a60386cd"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"title-writing","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"1dc787a8502cae8748cc9e25cbb54129d3a2dc83edf4defcbda7aac0e733afae"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"title-writing","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"e8eeca30c8e10da182c3fd3e38ee43bd8846682b5aa259ea41ab60a71099be27"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"title-writing","tabId":"example","expectedBlockSha256":"679e0d0102bd84617da20d8fc3d57c24f9833bfbe65b8ba8a240118de5ed0035","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"f963e604c91ed674d52bf8205e82ffb9ecff719ed8b90f23b6498fc1aa397063","ruleVersion":"exam-goal-v4","ruleDigest":"cde4b0cf5c8f1542a5a662cc642037c39b9968aba1618b319d56fd8b62cb8033","receiptId":"app-ve02-independent-notes-q-app-ve02-000204-r2","signatureVersion":"notes-semantic-v1","signature":"6c909f129b27946515e40fb2098a2b1cfdea50a406ea2b7e89a63f83c9c17edd"},"knowledgeAtoms":[],"resolvedTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-ve02-000204","revision":2,"status":"review","subjectId":"verbal","categoryId":"main-idea","statement":"主动制造敌之隙","conclusion":"文段重点是发