制解决欠薪，没有对应取证困难。；只说法规培训，没有直接对应证据留存和取证机制。；只是泛称法规问题，未承接证据不足这一明确问题。","taskActionRationale":"保留现有笔记题干、选项、答案和解析，仅在题目前透明补充由公开同题题面恢复的作答方向。","sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"next-paragraph","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"d086925abd7dbb15e3db63b502ee408b41db1a4a6695833c414f72fad7516e13"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"next-paragraph","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"1e74993f33822bdf4e81a3c53b2aff0c584e70b91d6de4b354f1c1a9f7a1540e"}],"knowledgeRelationEvidence":{"kind":"original-task-with-evidenced-neutral-direction-completion","pointIds":["next-paragraph"],"reason":"问题型文段的后续通常给针对性对策，对策必须同时对应农民工、欠薪和证据不足。"},"sourceProvenance":{"kind":"curated-note-example-with-external-task-direction-recovery","authorIdentity":"unknown","examProvenance":"unverified-unless-separately-established"},"reviewVerified":false}],"assessmentFingerprint":"bb9663b7","semanticRuntimeSignature":"ff605ed77f9ae879ed27f585f5aaeb4ff656ae06541f7a1c3c314ec068cde315"},{"id":"notes-q-app-ve02-000207","revision":2,"status":"review","subjectId":"verbal","categoryId":"main-idea","exerciseKinds":["application"],"sourceKind":"legacy-unverified","familyId":"notes-origin-notes-source-example-000207","exposureGroupId":"notes-exposure-notes-source-example-000207","answerMode":"single-choice","origin":{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"next-paragraph","tabId":"example","sourceExampleRecordId":"notes-source-example-000207","expectedBlockSha256":"8be443e5622ddeaf4ee6d3ebf85c80ccb332f68e151a629c7b87a9cb1aa11611"},"originAdaptation":{"kind":"neutral-display-completion","instruction":"选择这段文字接下来最可能讲述的一项。","reason":"现有笔记块保留题干、四个选项、答案和解析，但遗漏题目问法；公开同题题面核对出原任务方向。仅补中性作答说明，不改变现有题目内容或宣称官方题源。"},"assessment":{"taskType":"complete-application","knowledgeAtomIds":[],"requiresCalculation":false},"primaryTargetIds":["notes-target-app-ve02-000207"],"supportingTargetIds":[],"refs":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"next-paragraph","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"d086925abd7dbb15e3db63b502ee408b41db1a4a6695833c414f72fad7516e13","fingerprint":"7557a66a"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"next-paragraph","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"1e74993f33822bdf4e81a3c53b2aff0c584e70b91d6de4b354f1c1a9f7a1540e","fingerprint":"b19fee58"}],"distractorReasons":{"B":"碳测年法原理已用于解释困难，不是待展开的新话题。","C":"考古应用并非末句直接落点。","D":"技术原理前文已经说明。"},"originTask":{"verified":true,"statement":"碳酸铅为无机化合物，它以白铅矿的形式存在于自然界中。像碳酸铅这样的无机样本很难直接进行年代测定。这是因为，自然界中的碳元素主要有3种同位素，其中碳14为天然放射性同位素，碳测年法就是利用生物体死亡后体内碳14含量随时间减少的规律进行年代测定的技术，主要用于测定生物物质，例如动植物遗骸，也可以测定藏品中木器、竹器、牙骨器、纸张、纺织物等含碳有机物的年代。虽然碳酸铅含有放射性碳，可惜长期以来，科学家一直没能找到直接测定碳酸铅年代的方法。\n接下来最可能说的是：","evidence":"公开同题题面与现有题干、选项和答案相符；仅恢复作答方向，考试年份与官方真题身份未认证。"},"reviewVerified":false,"resourceType":"question","prompt":"选择这段文字接下来最可能讲述的一项。\n碳酸铅为无机化合物，它以白铅矿的形式存在于自然界中。像碳酸铅这样的无机样本很难直接进行年代测定。这是因为，自然界中的碳元素主要有3种同位素，其中碳14为天然放射性同位素，碳测年法就是利用生物体死亡后体内碳14含量随时间减少的规律进行年代测定的技术，主要用于测定生物物质，例如动植物遗骸，也可以测定藏品中木器、竹器、牙骨器、纸张、纺织物等含碳有机物的年代。虽然碳酸铅含有放射性碳，可惜长期以来，科学家一直没能找到直接测定碳酸铅年代的方法。","options":[{"key":"A","text":"测定碳酸铅年代的新方法"},{"key":"B","text":"碳测年法的优势和弊端"},{"key":"C","text":"碳酸铅和考古的关系"},{"key":"D","text":"碳测年法的技术原理"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"A 尾句提出长期没有直接测定碳酸铅年代的方法，后文最可能介绍新的测定方法。B 碳测年法原理已用于解释困难，不是待展开的新话题。C 考古应用不是尾句直接落点。D 技术原理前文已经说明。","originalExampleFingerprint":"76bdca26","declaredOriginalSource":"2022天津","answerSourceKeys":["[\"verbal\",\"next-paragraph\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-app-ve02-000207","questionRevision":2,"effectiveContentDigest":"56ebd023ee83b9ac61ef26c49ffc89460cde7e2b54f9ba1791ed95e23b0c9fb0"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-app-ve02-000207","revision":2,"sha256":"c2d5c3af6a5b681feefe0e5b92d3ba3fb37a7c705771bd61a54cc15a133e43cb"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"next-paragraph","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"1e74993f33822bdf4e81a3c53b2aff0c584e70b91d6de4b354f1c1a9f7a1540e"},{"subjectId":"verbal","pointId":"next-paragra